Package: rustima
Title: Seasonal ARIMA Models Powered by Rust
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("zongseung", email = "new9279@gachon.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits seasonal autoregressive integrated moving average models
    with optional regression terms using a shared Rust engine. Provides
    Kalman likelihood evaluation, Basin optimization, forecasting, and
    independent batch fits and automatic ARIMA order selection without a
    Python runtime.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: stats
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc (>= 1.87), xz
URL: https://github.com/zongseung/rustima
BugReports: https://github.com/zongseung/rustima/issues
